    "description": "You are particularly in tune with <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Living_Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Living Force\">The Living Force</a>. When you successfully use <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Search_Your_Feelings\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Search Your Feelings\">Search Your Feelings</a>, you gain a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> that must be used before the end of the encounter.<br><br>If you use this <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> in a manner that would end in unfavorable results (per <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Search_Your_Feelings\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Search Your Feelings\">Search Your Feelings</a>), you raise your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side_Score\" title=\"Dark Side Score\">Dark Side Score</a> by 1. lf you use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> in an action that would normally raise your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side_Score\" title=\"Dark Side Score\">Dark Side Score</a>, you raise your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Side_Score\" title=\"Dark Side Score\">Dark Side Score</a> by 2 instead.",
